1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,720
We are team SpaceOooops.

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:06,510
Students rarely get to fly a whole space mission,
so we built one.

3
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:11,350
SpaceOooops: design it, launch it,
find out why it failed.

4
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:16,510
Every choice is a trade-off: a better instrument
costs mass, power and money.

5
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:19,670
Pass the launch review, survive solar flares.

6
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:24,030
Fail, learn, fly again,
solo or as a crew of four.

7
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:27,950
Then read a debrief grounded in
NASA mission design guides.

